{"seq":34,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-fix-2026-10b/openclaw-haiku-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory-fix/cn-05-coastal-date-formats/r3","wall_ts":"2026-10-28T13:45:48.885Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-16T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"9326b54e95e3fea9568eb2996726cfac663f52703f0738fdeb8fe5b9a1ba221a","actor":"assistant","via":"gbrain","tool":"gbrain.search","kind":"read","args":{"query":"Kwame Pellucid Harbor Logistics handoff official date"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"pages":["heldout/notes/2025-12-08-bettina-pellucid-cutover-recap"],"count":1,"latency_ms":186,"sources":["public"],"facts":[{"fact":"Kwame Adjei-Rowe (kwame-adjei, Account manager, Coastal team) wrote in #coastal-team on 2026-10-16 09:00: Same question from me for the CRM: what was the official date Pellucid Harbor Logistics changed hands to me?","id":7,"source":"kwame-adjei, #coastal-team, 2026-10-16T09:00:00-05:00"},{"fact":"Bettina Kroll (bettina-kroll, Coastal team lead) wrote in #coastal-team on 2026-10-16 09:00: When did Pellucid Harbor Logistics officially change hands to Kwame? Moss had it in a Coastal digest and I need the date for the coverage tracker.","id":5,"source":"bettina-kroll, #coastal-team, 2026-10-16T09:00:00-05:00"},{"fact":"assistant (the workspace bot) wrote in #coastal-team on 2026-10-16 09:00: Bettina, the answer depends on which date you want, and the sources differ:\n\n- **Official handoff: 3 November 2025.** Moss's 2 November digest says the account \"changes hands tomorrow, 2025-11-03,\" and your own cutover recap (dated 8 December 2025) also calls 3 November the official handoff.\n- **Kwame's full takeover: 22 November 2025.** Your recap says you kept running PHL day to day through 21 November for the terminal cutover, and that Kwame fully took over on 22 November.\n\nFor the coverage tracker, I'd use 3 Nov 2025 as the official change of hands and note 22 Nov 2025 as the date Kwame took over day-to-day. Tell me if you want it recorded differently.","id":6,"source":"assistant, #coastal-team, 2026-10-16T09:00:00-05:00"}]},"grant":"kwame-adjei"}
